      "1 HUNTER CLADE operative selected from the following list: SICARIAN INFILTRATOR PRINCEPS with one option from each of the following: Flechette blaster or stubcarbine; Power weapon or taser goad; SICARIAN RUSTSTALKER PRINCEPS; SKITARII RANGER ALPHA with one of the following options: Galvanic rifle; gun butt; Master-crafted radium pistol; power weapon; Or one option from each of the following: Arc pistol or phosphor blast pistol; Arc maul or taser goad; SKITARII VANGUARD ALPHA with one of the following options: Radium carbine; gun butt; Master-crafted radium pistol; power weapon; Or one option from each of the following: Arc pistol or phosphor blast pistol; Arc maul or taser goad",
